card.statement:
If $ {\mathcal P_1}:
\pair{U_1}{V_1}{\mathcal A_1}{\mathcal
B_1}$ is a pair of linear mappings in
which ${\mathcal A_1}$ and ${\mathcal
B_1}$ are surjective, then replace it
with the pair

\begin{equation}
\xymatrix@R=20pt@C=40pt{
{\mathcal P_2=\alg_3({\mathcal P_1}):
\hspace{-1cm}}
&{U_2:=U_1/\Ker\mathcal B_1}
\ar@<0.3ex>[r]^{\mathcal A_2\ \ }
\ar@<-0.3ex>[r]_{\mathcal B_2\ \ }
&{V_1/\mathcal A_1(\Ker\mathcal B_1)
=:V_2}}.
\end{equation}
